		<r3d:repositoryName language="eng">RADAR4KIT</r3d:repositoryName>
				<r3d:additionalName language="eng">Research Data Repository for KIT</r3d:additionalName>
				<r3d:repositoryUrl>https://radar.kit.edu/</r3d:repositoryUrl>
				<r3d:description language="eng">RADAR4KIT enables KIT researchers to manage, archive, share in project teams and publish their research data in a repository. It allows users to compile research data from completed scientific studies and projects into data packages, describe them with metadata, store them permanently and archive them or make them publicly accessible if required. Published data are given a persistent identifier (DOI) and can thus be found internationally and are also referenced in KITopen. The operator is the Karlsruhe Institute of Technology (KIT). RADAR4KIT is based on the RADAR service offered by FIZ Karlsruhe. The data is stored exclusively on the KIT IT infrastructure at the Scientific Computing Center (SCC).</r3d:description>
